uple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10005","city":"CS1028","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[63,69,64,57,56,55],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"98","reputation":"2700","equipment":{"weapon":"WP21007","armor":"WP1001905","helmet":"WP1023305"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"魏国武将，金城太守。邓艾伐蜀时，杨欣奉命率兵烧毁甘松的营地，返途中与姜维交战，战败跌下马后险被姜维所杀，在魏军援救后逃走。","tc":"魏國武將，金城太守。鄧艾伐蜀時，楊欣奉命率兵燒毀甘松的營地，返途中與姜維交戰，戰敗跌下馬后險被姜維所殺，在魏軍援救后逃走。","en":"A military officer of Wei and Governor of Jincheng. During Deng Ai's invasion of Shu, Yang Xin was ordered to lead troops to burn the encampment at Gansong. On his return journey, he clashed with Jiang Wei, was defeated, and fell from his horse, nearly killed by Jiang Wei before being rescued by Wei soldiers and escaping.","jp":"魏の武将。金城太守。鄧艾の蜀討伐の際、楊欣は命を受けて兵を率い甘松の陣営を焼き払った。帰途に姜維と交戦して敗れ、落馬して危うく姜維に討ち取られそうになったが、魏軍の救援により逃げ延びた。","kr":"위나라의 무장이자 금성태수입니다. 등애가 촉을 정벌할 때 양흔은 명을 받들어 군사를 이끌고 감송의 군영을 불태웠습니다. 돌아오는 길에 강유와 교전하다 패하여 말에서 떨어진 뒤 강유에게 목숨을 잃을 뻔했으나, 위군의 구원을 받아 달아났습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10705","remark":"","surname":"杨","surnameTc":"楊","surnameEn":"Yang","surnameJp":"楊","surnameKr":"양","surnameOther":"","name":"欣","nameTc":"欣","nameEn":"Xin","nameJp":"欣","nameKr":"흔","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"杨欣","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"239","city":"CS1031","gender":"0","rule":"63","force":"69","wise":"64","politics":"57","charm":"56","will":"55","ruleTalent":"6","forceTalent":"7","wiseTalent":"6","politicsTalent":"5","charmTalent":"5","willTalent":"5","weaponMaster":"30/71/30/30/30/22/50/30","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttrib